{"3337440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BARREN", "steam_appid": 3337440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of BARREN is to deliver a deeply immersive and replayable experience through demanding gameplay, diverse enemies, environmental storytelling and a highly interactive world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weapon simulation enabled by a fully procedural animation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying points of interests with lots of tactical layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive object interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environnemental story telling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/7e605b799301321851a7c5143800a19a.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of BARREN is to deliver a deeply immersive and replayable experience through demanding gameplay, diverse enemies, environmental storytelling and a highly interactive world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic weapon simulation enabled by a fully procedural animation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/44545765b8d88bb0d78a56252f5bbaab.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varying points of interests with lots of tactical layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physical enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive object interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.poster.avif?t=1775095228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.webm?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/b7762e07bcd804ca3d5405a3c813a346.mp4?t=1775095228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><